{
    "title": "Trucker Tools",
    "description": "Trucker Tools is your digital co-driver for smooth operations. Find, book, and track loads\u2014all from your phone. Access key points of interest, fuel, and weight calculators. Trucker Tools is trusted by over 350k drivers, helping you stay ahead on the road.\r\n\r\n==Find & Book Loads==\r\n\r\n- Reduce calls to brokers with a detailed and updated load board\r\n- See rates and submit quotes directly from your phone\r\n- Book loads quickly with the Book-It-Now feature\r\n\r\n==Track Your Loads==\r\n\r\n- Driver-controlled tracking ends when the load is complete\r\n- Start, pause, and stop the load track\r\n- Automatically send updates to reduce check calls\r\n\r\n==Plan Your Trip==\r\n\r\n- Locate truck stops, fuel stations, and Walmarts\r\n- Access a real-time fuel price guide\r\n- Find weigh scales, rest areas, truck washes, and medical care\r\n\r\n==Essential Tools for Truckers==\r\n\r\n- Routing and fuel optimizer\r\n- Axle weight calculator for precise load management\r\n\r\nLearn more about our carrier-forward capacity sourcing and load-tracking solutions at https://www.truckertools.com\r\n\r\nFollow us on social media @trucker_tools\r\n\r\nTerms of Use and Privacy Policy: https://www.truckertools.com/terms\r\n\r\nHave a question? Contact us at https://www.truckertools.com/contact-us",
    "descriptionHTML": "Trucker Tools is your digital co-driver for smooth operations. Find, book, and track loads\u2014all from your phone. Access key points of interest, fuel, and weight calculators. Trucker Tools is trusted by over 350k drivers, helping you stay ahead on the road.<br><br>==Find &amp; Book Loads==<br><br>- Reduce calls to brokers with a detailed and updated load board<br>- See rates and submit quotes directly from your phone<br>- Book loads quickly with the Book-It-Now feature<br><br>==Track Your Loads==<br><br>- Driver-controlled tracking ends when the load is complete<br>- Start, pause, and stop the load track<br>- Automatically send updates to reduce check calls<br><br>==Plan Your Trip==<br><br>- Locate truck stops, fuel stations, and Walmarts<br>- Access a real-time fuel price guide<br>- Find weigh scales, rest areas, truck washes, and medical care<br><br>==Essential Tools for Truckers==<br><br>- Routing and fuel optimizer<br>- Axle weight calculator for precise load management<br><br>Learn more about our carrier-forward capacity sourcing and load-tracking solutions at https://www.truckertools.com<br><br>Follow us on social media @trucker_tools<br><br>Terms of Use and Privacy Policy: https://www.truckertools.com/terms<br><br>Have a question? Contact us at https://www.truckertools.com/contact-us",
